  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan compares it to an Earth Treasury flower for holding Gu worms. The chamber walls are filled with open mouths that show clenched white teeth and let out strange laughter.",
        "chapters": [
          224
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Before anyone knocks, one mouth drops its teeth on its own and extends a scarlet tongue that presents a pocket-sized bone book. That book tells the successor to knock teeth in the chamber to open mouths and take hibernating Gu inside. Bai Ning Bing then knocks, stops a mouth’s laughter, and receives a hibernating Gu on the tongue.",
        "chapters": [
          224
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Opening a mouth by knocking relies on luck. A mouth has ten pairs of teeth, and at least five must be knocked in the correct order before the teeth fall off.",
        "chapters": [
          225
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Successful knocks can yield hibernating Gu or open a mouth into a new secret tunnel.",
        "chapters": [
          224
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai clan talk treats those mouths like drawers for treasures.",
        "chapters": [
          225
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
